Description

The T-Shirt Shopping Web App is a full-stack e-commerce application where users can browse T-shirts, add items to a cart, and place orders online.
The system also includes an admin panel to manage products and store data in a database.

Features

Browse available T-shirts
Add products to cart
Place orders with customer details
Admin login to add and manage products
Persistent product storage in database
Email notification to admin when an order is placed

Install dependencies

npm install

Run the server

node server.js